This directory contains auxiliary libraries still retained by Packfall.

Packfall no longer uses the old LAMMPS-style `lib/*` workflow for most
historical packages. Legacy library directories that were carried over from
upstream but are not part of the supported Packfall build have been removed to
keep the source tree focused on maintained features.

Currently retained library directories:

poems         POEMS rigid-body integration library used by the in-tree
              `POEMS` package (`fix poems`)

For current build guidance, see the top-level `README.md`. For POEMS-specific
build details, see `lib/poems/README` and `src/POEMS/Install.sh`.
